{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Previously, I reviewed and downloaded database audits as an administrator. In real operations, the configurator and reviewer may differ. Auditors should be able to inspect evidence with their own accounts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I created a separate audit role, viewed order changes and DML Snapshot, and downloaded evidence. Database configuration returned No Permission. Separate roles made responsibilities explicit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Creating a Role with Audit Policies"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Under General → User Management → Roles, I created DB Audit Reviewer, described as responsible for reviewing order-database audits and exporting evidence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assign Policies lets you choose policies. I first selected Database Audit Full Access for database audit menus."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/01.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 1. Selecting Database Audit Full Access for the auditor role.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 1. Selecting Database Audit Full Access for the auditor role."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I assigned Database Audit Full Access and Report Audit Full Access, enabling audit review and Reports downloads. I added no user-management or database-configuration policies."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/02.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 2. DB Audit Reviewer contains the two audit/report policies.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 2. DB Audit Reviewer contains the two audit/report policies."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Policy names and descriptions make the assignment clear. This role explicitly includes audit downloads."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assigning the Role to an Auditor"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I created Demo Auditor, selected DB Audit Reviewer in Users → Admin Role, and applied it. The existing administrator remained Owner."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/03.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 3. Demo Auditor assigned DB Audit Reviewer; existing administrator remains Owner.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 3. Demo Auditor assigned DB Audit Reviewer; existing administrator remains Owner."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After signing in as the auditor, the administration view showed Audit, Reports, and database audits, but no General or database configuration menus visible to Owner."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/04.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 4. Audit-focused menus in Demo Auditor’s administration view.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 4. Audit-focused menus in Demo Auditor’s administration view."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Opening the Developer’s Order Change"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In Query Audit I found Part 19’s No.293: Demo Developer, Success, Orders Control Lab, execution time, 69 ms, and SQL Request."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/05.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 5. The auditor views details of the developer’s UPDATE.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 5. The auditor views details of the developer’s UPDATE."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The auditor used a personal account rather than borrowing an operator’s or administrator’s. User and execution route were directly inspectable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Auditor Checks Before and After Values Too"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The same UPDATE in DML Snapshots showed order 4003 status PENDING before and DELIVERED after, matching the earlier administrator review."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/06.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 6. Auditor’s DML Snapshot After shows order 4003 as DELIVERED.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 6. Auditor’s DML Snapshot After shows order 4003 as DELIVERED."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Beyond SQL success, the auditor could inspect actual changed values, reducing requests for screenshots from operational administrators."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Database Configuration Is Not Accessible"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I directly opened a database configuration URL with the same account. It showed No Permission and denied access."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/07.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 7. Auditor access to database configuration returns No Permission.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 7. Auditor access to database configuration returns No Permission."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The auditor reviews evidence while operational administrators retain configuration duties. This was enforced on direct URLs too, not just by hiding menus."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Downloading Evidence with the Same Account"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Audit Log Export showed Part 20’s task as Completed. Demo Auditor clicked Download."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/administrator-roles/08.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 8. Auditor downloading completed evidence from Audit Log Export.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 8. Auditor downloading completed evidence from Audit Log Export."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The extracted CSV matched the administrator’s copy: one SELECT and one approved UPDATE. The auditor could review and obtain evidence independently."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Separate roles avoid repeatedly asking administrators for evidence. Auditors can inspect history, changed values, and files using their own accounts, while configuration privileges remain separate. QueryPie’s administrative access can follow organizational responsibilities."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This lab used fictional users and order-database audit records in QueryPie Community 11.6.7."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
